"""co0038 adds memorized transactions: templates, their versions, their derived reference
index, their occurrences, and the group runs that freeze a scheduled membership.

Purely additive. No existing table is rebuilt and no existing trigger is rewritten, so nothing
a company already holds is touched; the seven new tables must be absent and stay empty until a
command writes to them.
"""
